# Backend Rules

## Stack

Node.js + Express.js + JWT + Nodemailer

## Route Organization

```
/api/auth          — staff/admin login
/api/bookings      — CRUD (public POST for new bookings; staff/admin for management)
/api/sales         — staff/admin only
/api/reports       — staff/admin only
/api/analytics     — admin only
/api/users         — admin only
/api/recommendations — public (rule-based package suggestions)
/api/email         — admin config; internal triggers for notifications
```

## Middleware

- `authenticateToken` — verify JWT on protected routes
- `requireRole('staff' | 'admin')` — enforce role access

## Email (Nodemailer)

Types: booking confirmation, booking approval, promotional campaigns, anniversary reminders (1 year before event date).

Log every send to `EmailLogs` table.

## Scheduled Jobs

- Daily/weekly/monthly/annual report generation
- Anniversary promotional emails (query completed bookings where event_date anniversary is ~30 days away)

## Responses

Use consistent JSON: `{ success, data, message }` or `{ success, error }`.
